          "text": " And he said to them, “Take heed what you hear; the measure you give will be the measure you get, and still more will be given you. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.24"
            ]
