                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " On that day, when evening had come, he said to them, “Let us go across to the other side.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And leaving the crowd, they took him with them in the boat, just as he was. And other boats were with him. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And a great storm of wind arose, and the waves beat into the boat, so that the boat was already filling. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But he was in the stern, asleep on the cushion; and they woke him and said to him, “Teacher, do you not care if we perish?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he awoke and rebuked the wind, and said to the sea, “Peace! Be still!” And the wind ceased, and there was a great calm. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He said to them, “Why are you afraid? Have you no faith?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And they were filled with awe, and said to one another, “Who then is this, that even wind and sea obey him?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.41"
            ]
          }
        }
